{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とぅりゃっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どや顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツボすぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、みゅうみゅう好きすぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで何を描いてるんだか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は雷なってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雷きょわい。\nやんなっちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週土曜日は個握だね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服迷うー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くにぎにぎしたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん会いたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くライブしたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握も楽しみだなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..............\nところで細かいんだけど、\n万理華ちゃんってホテルだと裸足なの？（笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真では見えないと思いますが\n片足スリッパ履いてるのよ^^笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠征の宿泊先でもマクラに顔を\nうずめてクシャクシャ(^^)するの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりメイク取ってからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しなきゃ落ち着かない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"127回の写真のTシャツどこの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"RNAです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってか、マリカッシさぁ、フジテレビの\n平井アナに似てるって言われない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて言われた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番に推してもいい＞＜？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しいです‼\nありがとうございますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔のマッサージってどんなの？(ﾉﾟοﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんによくやってもらうマッサージを\nまねしてみたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リンパマッサージ的なやつです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからまりかちゃんだけにコメントしてもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしっかり読んでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです。よろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華ちゃんみたいに可愛くなる秘訣は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうー><"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント\n最初まりかちゃんかわよ\nから始まってるのしってる？☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさん、最近大人っぽいですねー！\n髪型のせいですか？なんのせいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"童顔だけど大人だもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はははっ  どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも写真に絵描くときってペンとか使ってますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手で描いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまととわったっし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も元気に頑張りまりか:D\n学校学校"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/0255517/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}